  "review": {
    "summary": "The packet defines strong fail-closed scanning, artifact validation, reviewer triage, and verification contracts, but the scanner retains a mutable executable symlink after validation and V2 does not require causal attribution of the mutant failure. The executable-binding defect is high severity, so the fixed rubric fails.",
